淡心灵空</span><span begin="38.586" end="39.806">洞</span> <span begin="39.806" end="40.842">Aw</span></p></div><div begin="41.390" end="1:08.941" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="41.390" end="46.065" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="41.390" end="42.126">一点</span><span begin="42.126" end="42.548">点</span> <span begin="42.658" end="43.257">给你</span><span begin="43.257" end="43.558">你</span><span begin="43.558" end="43.738">的</span><span begin="43.738" end="46.065">爱</span></p><p begin="46.534" end="50.687" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="46.534" end="47.258">一点</span><span begin="47.258" end="47.707">点</span> <span begin="47.815" end="48.409">发出</span><span begin="48.409" end="48.725">你</span><span begin="48.725" end="48.944">的</span><span begin="48.944" end="50.687">光</span></p><p begin="51.722" end="56.475" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="51.722" end="52.400">付出</span><span begin="52.400" end="52.911">一点</span><span begin="52.911" end="53.841">点</span> <span begin="54.030" end="54.379">就会</span><span begin="54.379" end="55.641">改变全世</span><span begin="55.641" end="56.475">界</span></p><p begin="56.845" end="1:02.650" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="56.845" end="57.553">就是</span><span begin="57.553" end="57.869">差</span><span begin="57.869" end="58.098">你</span><span begin="58.098" end="58.472">这</span><span begin="58.472" end="58.715">么</span><span begin="58.715" end="59.495">一点</span><span begin="59.495" end="1:02.650">点</span></p><p begin="1:03.971" end="1:08.941" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="1:03.971" end="1:04.240">一</span><span begin="1:04.240" end="1:04.566">点</span><span begin="1:04.566" end="1:08.941">点</span></p></div><div begin="1:10.094" end="1:28.881" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:10.094" end="1:14.250" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="1:10.094" end="1:10.503">当</span><span begin="1:10.503" end="1:10.939">你的</span><span begin="1:10.939" end="1:11.639">心头</spa